# DIY page modules

| Region | Responsibility | Entry |
|--------|-----------------|--------|
| Markup | `#page-diy` + help modal | `pages/diy/page.html` |
| Boot | Mount + wire canvas/UI | `pages/diy/index.js` |
| Top | Wrist sum(diameters), price sum, help modal | `pages/diy/ui/topBar.js` |
| Main | Fixed circular track; beads head-to-tail; drag reorder; drag-out delete | `pages/diy/canvas/*` |
| Middle | Clear all; Recommend stub; Make Now → callback | `pages/diy/ui/middleBar.js` |
| Shelf | L1 Beads/Accessories; L2 categories; cards | `pages/diy/ui/shelf.js` |

Design Details lives separately under `src/pages/details/` — DIY must not import details internals; use `onMakeNow` + `shared/nav.js`.

## Interaction contracts

- **Add**: tap shelf card → `addBead(productId)` → append to string end → relayout
- **Reorder**: pointer drag along ring → drop → `reorderBead(from, to)` by nearest angle
- **Delete one**: drag beyond track + threshold → `removeBead(instanceId)`
- **Clear**: middle trash → `clearBeads()`
- **Wrist meta**: always `sum(diameterMm)`; track visual radius stays fixed even when total > one loop
- **Recommend**: toast/stub only in MVP
- **Make Now**: `onMakeNow()` from boot → Design Details (requires ≥1 bead)

## Product card data shape

```js
{ id, type: 'bead'|'accessory', category, name, diameterMm, highMm, price, color, image, supply }
```

- Catalog source: `new_input/commodity_idx.xlsx` → `npm run sync:catalog` → `src/shared/data/catalog.json`
- `diameterMm` ← Excel `size_mm` (cord occupancy); `highMm` ← Excel `high_mm` (face / hanging body)
- `image` is `/products/<picture>` from the Excel `picture` column
- Same `name`/picture may back multiple SKUs (different size/price/`id`)

Keep Shopify metafield mapping in `docs/shopify-metafields.md` for later swap-in.
